Date: Wed, 13 Feb 2019 00:13:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] SystemUI: Add lockscreen charging info

Add charging current, wattage, voltage and battery temperature to the
lockscreen charging indication while the device is plugged in.

Use realtime current and voltage values when available and fall back to
values exposed through ACTION_BATTERY_CHANGED.

Also use the generic wired charging indication instead of relying on the
charging speed label, since the actual charging stats are displayed
directly.

Based on prior work from maxwen, yank555-lu and nathanchance

Change-Id: Ifec2ada6b0acc0357e982a04633f9ee03ccb98b8
Signed-off-by: dkpost3 <dkpost3@gmail.com>
